---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Correspondence" description="Contact Mathim Divisions regarding research, technical work, writing, and collaboration.">
  <section class="interior-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal"></span>Communications / Open channel</p>
      <h1>Start a<br /><em>conversation.</em></h1>
      <p>Projects, inquiries, collaboration, or a question with no obvious department. We can start with an email.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="editorial-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-topline"><span class="eyebrow">General correspondence</span><span class="index">MD / COMMS</span></div>
      <div class="contact-details">
        <h2>The right<br />department<br />is listening.</h2>
        <div>
          <p>For technical work, writing, collaborations, or questions about Mathim Divisions, this is the place to begin.</p>
          <p>There is no elaborate intake process. Write with a little context about what you're working on, and we'll take it from there.</p>
          <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:cassie@mathimdivisions.com">cassie@mathimdivisions.com ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>